[{"client_msg_id":"319346f6-9afe-431e-9600-9b0d716d2383","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いま、スマートコントラクト関連でETHは取引が活性ですからね(流通通貨)\nBTCは若干投機対象化してますから流通は穏やか(でも多すぎたために仕組みの改善は都度ありました)","ts":"1631363321.302900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KcknP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14575775-60a6-4b10-ac5c-2f504e6304b5","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ふむ、BTCでもtransaction feeというものは発生するらしいが今は$2.5程度か。ETHに比べると1/10程度\n\u003chttps://bitinfocharts.com/comparison/bitcoin-transactionfees.html#1y\u003e","ts":"1631363169.301900","attachments":[{"fallback":"BitInfoCharts: Bitcoin Avg. Transaction Fee Chart","id":1,"title":"Bitcoin Avg. Transaction Fee Chart","title_link":"https://bitinfocharts.com/comparison/bitcoin-transactionfees.html#1y","text":"Bitcoin Average transaction fee, USD Chart","thumb_url":"https://bitinfocharts.com/logo-1200.jpg","blocks":null,"service_name":"BitInfoCharts","service_icon":"https://bitinfocharts.com/apple-touch-icon.png","thumb_width":1200,"thumb_height":1200,"from_url":"https://bitinfocharts.com/comparison/bitcoin-transactionfees.html#1y","original_url":"https://bitinfocharts.com/comparison/bitcoin-transactionfees.html#1y"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cym"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U76GA7MFA","text":"\u003c@U76GA7MFA\u003e has left the channel","ts":"1631363140.301700","subtype":"channel_leave","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"26ff6265-9105-4c2d-98e1-570b89d39125","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、元のは著者の証明くらいだったのが、資産の移動も含めた表現ができるというのはある","ts":"1631362625.299500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/pO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d44de2d4-0fdb-4d99-b0f3-bedd25b207d1","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと、最近話題のNFTとかは、昔「タイムスタンプサーバと署名サービスがあれば、ユーザーのデジタル資産を表現できるんじゃね」のブロックチェーン版ですね\nブロックチェーンだと、タイムスタンプの信頼性が、精密でなくても前後関係からより強いのが良いというところはある(あとだれでも安心して採番される)","ts":"1631362574.298900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zii8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bdd442dc-1c9a-4802-9128-51f146b83601","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"BTCでの各トランザクションにコメントを入れることはできたけど、そこを拡張したみたいに思ってもらえれば","ts":"1631362478.297100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"++0j"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7c0e025c-8aa6-4117-b4e8-e6f181e9f9e3","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"仕組みの詳細までは勉強してませんが、ETHは単純にブロックチェーンを繋ぐだけじゃなくて、そこにコントラクト(契約)データを仕込めるので、その仕込みのための作業をした人へ払う代金がgas代ですね","ts":"1631362452.296500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6mN7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9d06344-7afb-4b26-9813-d3642170b918","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"単純に興味ですが、このガス代って誰に払ってるんでしょう？ハッシュをマイニングした人？","ts":"1631362381.295500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"s/U8h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"663b1850-6ad2-4e12-ba7a-2930b53a4b5a","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"仕組みが違うのでなんとも、BTCは単価が高くなっちゃってますが\n他のいくつか(DOGE,MONAくらいしか触りませんが)はそこまでじゃない印象","ts":"1631361173.294900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7p3KU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97819927-31f8-4cb1-b595-b1096540dffb","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"ETHはガス代がクソ高いというのが身にしみるほどよく分かりましたが、ビットコインとか他の仮想通貨はどうなんですかね？","ts":"1631361014.294000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0jkn0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0dd2788-e958-4988-9732-10bd4ba9b352","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"へー","ts":"1631360934.292800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BOWQE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5f2e048-0ce3-4818-904c-4b043cbaf4ea","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"GMOコインとDMMビットコインはETHの送金手数料が無料らしいから、追加でどちらかに口座開設するのもありか？","ts":"1631360925.292600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Dc6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c7975313-c787-41e3-9561-9deb5786ee9c","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、今回のはちょっと手順が多いものだったので、素で通貨を遣り取りは1stepなんですけどねえ","ts":"1631360911.292400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YYZ50"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2e6adcf-107e-44ce-b66d-00d5818c0027","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"そして昼間、Coincheckの画面を見るのは気が散るのでやめた方がいい。","ts":"1631360857.291500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"laughing","count":1,"users":["U6XP9LZ6V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YutFt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"227a1872-0c98-44e0-aa3a-48460623ac64","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"僕も今回初めて仮想通貨やるけど手数料がこんなに掛かるとは思わなかった。","ts":"1631360788.289500","edited":{"user":"U03C6TEAZ","ts":"1631360812.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2O6zV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"efdc3ef9-d28a-42d6-8bd4-0933644ab557","type":"message","user":"U6XP9LZ6V","text":"そしてまだ試してないけど、stakeするためのgas代も多分払えないｗ","ts":"1631360631.288100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mup9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"da0161f8-ba37-4247-9bf2-0ea5d64e480f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"大分stakeして増えてくれないと元が取れませんね....","ts":"1631360556.287300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"u9ny"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46a44d7b-00c5-437a-b60c-5dcce3e7e4e5"